  <section class="section soft"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-box"><p class="eyebrow">Technical Review</p><h2>What Happens Next</h2><p class="copy">Send the records you already have. The technical team will identify missing information before design or production moves forward.</p><div class="submission-support"><article><h3>1. File Review</h3><p>We check the submitted files, prescription and restoration request.</p></article><article><h3>2. Missing Information</h3><p>Implant system, platform, scanbody or other required details are confirmed instead of guessed.</p></article><article><h3>3. Approval</h3><p>Design or production begins after the required technical information is clear.</p></article><article><h3>4. QC & Communication</h3><p>Case details and quality-control points are communicated through the delivery workflow.</p></article></div><div class="contact-links"><a class="btn btn-green" href="https://wa.me/8613714730109" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">WhatsApp: +86 137 1473 0109</a><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:yzhdentallab@gmail.com">yzhdentallab@gmail.com</a></div></div><div class="form"><p class="eyebrow">Case Submission</p><h2>Send Case for Review</h2><form id="caseForm" action="/api/submit-case" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><input class="sr-only" name="website" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" autocomplete="off"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field">Name *<input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required></label><label class="field">Lab / Company<input name="company" placeholder="Dental lab or clinic name"></label><label class="field">Email *<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="name@company.com" required></label><label class="field">WhatsApp<input name="whatsapp" placeholder="+1 ..."></label><label class="field">Country<input name="country" placeholder="USA, Australia, UK..."></label><label class="field">Case Type *<select name="case_type" required><option value="">Select case type</option><option>Implant Crown / Abutment</option><option>Full Arch / All-on-X</option><option>Crown & Bridge</option><option>Surgical Guide</option><option>Titanium Bar / Framework</option><option>Digital Design / Exocad</option><option>Removable / Other Restoration</option></select></label></div><label class="field" style="margin-top:14px">Message<textarea name="instructions" placeholder="Tell us what you want made, files available, due date, risk points or approval needs."></textarea></label><label class="field" style="margin-top:14px">Upload Files<input type="file" name="case_files" multiple accept=".stl,.ply,.zip,.pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png"></label><p class="upload-guidance">Accepted: STL, PLY, ZIP, PDF, JPG, JPEG and PNG. Maximum total request size: 25MB. For large CBCT or DICOM data, compress the files into a ZIP or include a secure file-sharing link in the Message field.</p><details><summary>Advanced Implant Details</summary><div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:14px"><label class="field">Implant Brand<input name="implant_brand" placeholder="Nobel, Straumann, Hiossen..."></label><label class="field">Implant System<input name="implant_system" placeholder="System / library name"></label><label class="field">Platform<input name="platform" placeholder="NP / RP / WP / MUA..."></label><label class="field">Restoration Type<input name="restoration_type" placeholder="Screw-retained, Ti-base, MUA..."></label><label class="field">Material<select name="material"><option value="">Select material</option><option>Zirconia</option><option>PMMA</option><option>Titanium</option><option>Emax</option><option>PFM</option><option>Design only</option><option>Need recommendation</option></select></label><label class="field">Shade<input name="shade" placeholder="A2, BL2, custom shade..."></label><label class="field">Quantity<input type="number" min="1" name="quantity" placeholder="1"></label><label class="field">Due Date<input type="date" name="due_date"></label></div></details><p class="privacy